| {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  | $\\,\\,x(t)+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-3}} |  |  | $\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-4}} |  | $\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-5}} | {{field-6}} |  |  | {{field-7}} |  |  | {{field-8}} |  |  |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=2\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+3\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+4\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+(-5)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=(-1)\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+1\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+3\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t)+[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186357084 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "51834713-edc2-5af3-a0dc-fb54ea4040c6" :knowledge-point/title "Writing Down an Inhomogeneous System of Linear ODEs in Matrix Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65a93aaa-4bdc-565f-a61b-895f4e600ae8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186357086}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "65a93aaa-4bdc-565f-a61b-895f4e600ae8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186357086} :answer-field/id #uuid "8da94b02-555e-504b-8fb2-5fc43b0a4a69" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186357085} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ec89110-3b45-5d58-b976-6888bb934954" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref